  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Incoming Dairy Visit from Angola</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of this Incoming Dairy Visit is to enhance bilateral cooperation and strengthen private sector partnerships in the dairy sector between Angola and the Netherlands. This visit aims to introduce Angolan stakeholders to Dutch dairy policy frameworks, institutions, and support mechanisms, while showcasing Dutch expertise across the entire dairy value chain - ranging from production and processing to logistics, finance, insurance, and innovation. Additionally, the Visit will facilitate direct business-to-business (B2B) engagement, opening up opportunities for trade, investment, and technical cooperation. It will also seek to identify concrete project ideas for continued collaboration after the mission. This year marks the 50th anniversary of Dutch-Angolan trade relations, making it a perfect moment to celebrate the long-standing partnership and to explore new opportunities for growth and cooperation in the dairy sector.</narrative>
  </description>
